<description>&lt;p&gt;Rebel and SPLA-IO forces have intensified attacks across South Sudan, killing civilians in Tonj East, Warrap State, and other locations, with recent incidents reporting 24 deaths including children and women. Cattle-theft raids have also turned lethal, leaving dozens dead and prompting fear of missing persons after assaults on islands such as Miny Island in Jonglei. The violence has spread to the political sphere, with the brother of former Juba Mayor James Allah-Jabu dying and the former vice president Igga announcing the death. The crisis now includes large-scale killings reported in Ruweng and ongoing insecurity ahead of the postponed 2026 election. According to UCDP, there were 2 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxNa0NoRUtIVWtnUGlMTUNxM3pkYUJXRzg4d3J5czV5N1RQZXpaNTl0U25vV0J4TDFIZWhfcHRIQUFOeXdoT1JnMUhZZ1U2eWFRZDlRWF9ERkdJV2xka2lMdkRyLUNUVVY1MkRKQnNDQmVYVTByemhFNWh6UDdqQnBVTThR?oc=5&quot;&gt;chagua.co.ke&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQZTdOOVBndi1ULUUxbjBuS0QtSmgwOGl1RXdPMkVYLW9lMU95bEFMSGxNLTVUSW92RDE3dzZjWlZVUHV0UGNtb0xCRThJaWFSdGNmNzdya3hKVlB6VklJX3R1VERSdVhVdGcwamFmOFpCRmlwY3NFV25kbzRmbmZlOHduQVpuaVpibHo4Tms0cGF1OHRWNl9UQnM4N3Y4MU0?oc=5&quot;&gt;جريدة القدس&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxON04yd1FELUplb1pndHRydUlEVjAyMC1MVFl2U3V5MHozWUpJeGlsVmVPZGpEdDczX1g4dXh4bGFLVHBhZjl4eXhJdmRVaTRvbkRuMGtTbHhhNnd5N0ZreVZlSUp3RHhjQXVwcWp6ZFF0MlZuQzdKV0ZFa2FpSG5oeGQ5REhOQTdkRkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;News of Bahrain&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https: